One Piece Card Game models (shipped in the built extension's release/ folder)
License: Apache-2.0
Upstream: https://huggingface.co/JuicyKaraageNo1/kenbunshoku-onepiece
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Release B2.1 (id f80d5b56cd907f03; the evaluated release B2, 26a98a0f49a74545, with one
catalog entry corrected and its identity grouping updated to match): a YOLOX-derived card
detector, fine-tuned from Megvii's COCO-pretrained YOLOX-Nano weights (Apache-2.0), and the
cardvision recognizer, trained by the open-source cardvision project on labels made on frames of
public videos plus composites made from official card art (the art is not included). The model files are not kept in this
repository; their LICENSE, NOTICE and PROVENANCE.md are, in release-legal/, and ship beside them.
